{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/131ce8e5c7b4cd30f8234468565a9960.poster.avif?t=1762900579\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/131ce8e5c7b4cd30f8234468565a9960.webm?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/131ce8e5c7b4cd30f8234468565a9960.mp4?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urbexophobia is a 1\u20134 player survival horror game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban exploration used to be a thrill. Tonight, it\u2019s a trap. Search, survive, and face your fears\u2014alone or with others.<br>Just remember one thing: <strong>You control nothing.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you dare open the door to the unknown?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors are spreading... Forgotten places, long abandoned, are said to hold dark secrets that should never have been disturbed.<br>Your passion for urbex pushes you inside. But once in, curiosity gives way to pure horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, failed experiments, forbidden technologies, and unpredictable entities\u2014what awaits you defies logic.<br>Once you enter, there\u2019s no going back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo or co-op \u2014 terror shared (or not)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness alone. No backup. No help.<br>Just you, your flashlight\u2026 and your nerves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Mode (1\u20134 online players)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the horror together. Team up with friends or strangers to survive and explore the ruins.<br>Communication and cooperation are your best weapons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/58083093b8e1f1fc3921006f9a74eca9.poster.avif?t=1762900579\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/58083093b8e1f1fc3921006f9a74eca9.webm?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/58083093b8e1f1fc3921006f9a74eca9.mp4?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A unique experience every time</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt the horrors</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Survive. Eliminate the entities haunting the area. That\u2019s your mission.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rising challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the creatures become faster, smarter, and deadlier.<br>Your only tools: what you can find... and your photon amplifier flashlight.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Items are randomly scattered in drawers, cabinets, and on the ground.<br>The monster AI is unpredictable\u2014you\u2019ll never feel safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/33c60485405dc250c16ba9d7a609e6a7.poster.avif?t=1762900579\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/33c60485405dc250c16ba9d7a609e6a7.webm?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/33c60485405dc250c16ba9d7a609e6a7.mp4?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 difficulty levels, 4 levels of hell</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: A discovery mode. Fewer enemies. Softer AI. Learn the basics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal: The real game begins. Creatures awaken... and they can hear you. Good luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: Relentless tension. The entities become brutal, clever, and unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urbexophobia: No HUD. No help. No hints. Pure horror. You\u2019re alone in the dark.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host or join games with friends or strangers. Built-in voice and text chat let you communicate in real time \u2014 but stay close\u2026 straying too far might cost you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your avatar with unlockable characters, animations, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/29000e4dc01b9e30eeb0d091da17c114.poster.avif?t=1762900579\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/29000e4dc01b9e30eeb0d091da17c114.webm?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/29000e4dc01b9e30eeb0d091da17c114.mp4?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Photosensitivity Warning</strong> \u26a0\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures for players with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919430?t=1762900579","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919430?t=1762900579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/f2c8777dc739f89cd6df8089efd2af2d735d9351/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762900579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/f2c8777dc739f89cd6df8089efd2af2d735d9351/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762900579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence involving monsters, featuring visual effects ranging from luminous disintegration to cartoonish explosions of rounded flesh pieces, without realistic blood or graphic mutilation. Some characters wear form-fitting clothing, but there is no explicit nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/131ce8e5c7b4cd30f8234468565a9960.poster.avif?t=1762900579\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/131ce8e5c7b4cd30f8234468565a9960.webm?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs