 and they can hear you. Good luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: Relentless tension. The entities become brutal, clever, and unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urbexophobia: No HUD. No help. No hints. Pure horror. You\u2019re alone in the dark.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host or join games with friends or strangers. Built-in voice and text chat let you communicate in real time \u2014 but stay close\u2026 straying too far might cost you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your avatar with unlockable characters, animations, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/29000e4dc01b9e30eeb0d091da17c114.poster.avif?t=1762900579\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/29000e4dc01b9e30eeb0d091da17c114.webm?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/29000e4dc01b9e30eeb0d091da17c114.mp4?t=1762900579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>Photosensitivity Warning</strong> \u26a0\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures for players with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</p>","developers":["Chosta Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/c13f27ff808c60d30b4cce8e309e45a88796dbb4/header.jpg?t=1762900579","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":